description "Ewok Tribesman

Archers, rock chuckers, and spear wielders of diminutive stature. They thrive on ambushes and pack behavior.

^2Weaponry:
- Bloody Paws (Melee)
-- Drains on hit
-- 50% faster RoF
-- 25% less damage
- Shortspear (Staff/Yellow Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 3
-- Drains on hit
-- 140% more special damage
-- 10% more knockback
-- 37/50% shorter
-- 66% thicker
- Stone (16)
-- 4900% more damage
-- 15% faster RoF
-- 900% larger splash
-- Primary fire only
- Shortbow (T-21 1)
-- Pushes/staggers on hit
-- 15% faster RoF
-- 50% less damage
-- Mag reload

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Getup (2)
- Assemble (2)
- 20% more knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS3]"